# .leakguardignore
# ============================================================
# Paths and fnmatch patterns to skip during staged-file scans.
# One pattern per line. Blank lines and lines starting with #
# are ignored.
#
# Note: patterns here are bypassed when files are passed
# explicitly on the CLI, e.g.:
#   python leakguard.py demo/fake_config.py   <- still scanned
# ============================================================

# Skip the demo folder from automatic staged-file scans.
# The demo folder contains deliberately fake secrets for testing.
demo/
